  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize melds. A Napola is worth 3 points immediately plus card values. Save your 3s, 2s, and Aces for this purpose. Don't play them on empty tricks if you can meld them.\n\nThe 'Pizzico': 'Nibbling' points. If you see your opponent collecting a suit for Napola, lead that suit to break their run or force them to play high.\n\nCounting the Tick: There are 10 points and 2/3rds in the deck. Total score is 11 points (plus melds). Knowing exactly how many points have been played is vital for the endgame squeeze.",
